<div class="card p-4">

    <h1>About RatPDF</h1>

    <p>
        <strong>RatPDF</strong> is a privacy-focused online platform that provides simple,
        fast, and secure tools for working with PDF documents.
    </p>

    <p>
        Our goal is to make PDF processing easy for everyone by offering tools that
        work directly inside your web browser without requiring software installation
        or complicated setups.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Our Mission</h3>

    <p>
        Our mission is to provide a fast, reliable, and privacy-friendly solution
        for common PDF tasks such as:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>PDF conversion</li>
        <li>PDF compression</li>
        <li>PDF merging</li>
        <li>PDF splitting</li>
        <li>PDF editing tools</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        We focus on simplicity, speed, and privacy to ensure users can process
        documents quickly and safely.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Privacy First Approach</h3>

    <p>
        RatPDF is designed with privacy as a core principle.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Files are processed directly in your browser.</li>
        <li>Documents are not uploaded to our servers.</li>
        <li>No files are stored in databases or server storage.</li>
        <li>Users maintain full control over their documents.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        This approach reduces privacy risks and ensures that your files remain
        completely under your control.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Why Choose RatPDF</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>Fast browser-based processing</li>
        <li>No software installation required</li>
        <li>Privacy-friendly architecture</li>
        <li>Easy-to-use tools</li>
        <li>Secure HTTPS website</li>
    </ul>

    <hr>

    <h3>Continuous Improvements</h3>

    <p>
        We are continuously improving our platform to deliver better performance,
        new PDF tools, and enhanced user experience.
    </p>

    <p>
        User feedback plays an important role in helping us improve the website
        and develop new features.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Contact Us</h3>

    <p>
        If you have questions, feedback, or suggestions, please visit our
        <a href="/Home/Contact">Contact Page</a>.
    </p>

</div>